# Original Marble Recovery level (2026-10-04). Not derived from any Marble Madness course.
# Teaches: gulpers (marble-eaters). They walk their beat and lunge at a marble that
# strays into reach, but never leave their own level: a ledge is a safe wall.
name: The Gulper Yard
time: 60
theme: classic
story: Something out here is hungry.
story: Gulpers mean no harm. They simply cannot tell a marble from a snack.
story: They never leave their own ground, though. Remember that.
